WEBVTT

1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,600
Take two pills a day, once in the morning and evening

2
00:00:01,600 --> 00:00:03,400
It should be enough to take it for about three to five days.

3
00:00:03,400 --> 00:00:05,200
If it doesn't work in three to five days, come back and see me again.

4
00:00:05,200 --> 00:00:07,100
This is a fever-reducing medicine that should be taken once every four hours.

5
00:00:07,100 --> 00:00:08,600
If it's not burned, don't eat it

6
00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:10,400
Don't worry, they have a high fever.

7
00:00:10,400 --> 00:00:12,600
High fever can be cured quickly

8
00:00:12,600 --> 00:00:13,600
Thank you Dr. Zhu

9
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:14,800
I have to go back beforehand

10
00:00:14,800 --> 00:00:16,400
What's the point of waiting a while?

11
00:00:16,400 --> 00:00:17,600
Don’t you still have to help me?

12
00:00:17,600 --> 00:00:19,000
I'll come back later

13
00:00:19,000 --> 00:00:20,500
Why don't you go carry someone's building this morning?

14
00:00:20,500 --> 00:00:24,900
Otherwise, I'm afraid that you're too dirty to fit in. It doesn't matter. I'll pay attention and come to your place at eleven o'clock.

15
00:00:24,900 --> 00:00:26,200
It won't waste your time

16
00:00:26,200 --> 00:00:33,930
Then I'll go first

17
00:00:33,930 --> 00:00:35,430
Come and ask for it, I've got it back

18
00:00:35,430 --> 00:00:37,330
These fresh medicines are indeed different from jade.

19
00:00:37,330 --> 00:00:38,330
How to take it

20
00:00:38,330 --> 00:00:39,330
One pill of this morning and evening

21
00:00:39,330 --> 00:00:41,430
This is a special antipyretic medicine with a bright cup in it.

22
00:00:41,430 --> 00:00:43,430
Just drink half a cup or two at a time. Drink it if you still have a fever.

23
00:00:43,430 --> 00:00:44,930
If you don’t have a fever, you don’t need to drink it.

24
00:00:44,930 --> 00:00:46,430
He said that the fever will go away soon after eating it.

25
00:00:46,430 --> 00:00:47,930
It is indeed a magical thing

26
00:00:47,930 --> 00:00:49,430
incredible

27
00:00:49,430 --> 00:00:54,410
I'll go immediately to reduce their fever, Brother Xiao.

28
00:00:54,410 --> 00:00:55,910
I thought you weren't coming

29
00:00:55,910 --> 00:00:57,310
It's past nine o'clock now
